homelab-grafana (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Embed support: ship a grafana-server systemd env drop-in (generated
    from /etc/homelab/grafana/config) putting Grafana behind accountmanage's
    /grafana reverse proxy -- served from the sub-path
    (serve_from_sub_path + root_url), authenticated by the trusted
    X-WEBAUTH-USER header accountmanage sets after a metrics.view check
    (auth_proxy, whitelisted to the accountmanage host), proxy users get
    Viewer, and allow_embedding so it renders inside the myaccount Metrics
    tab. Lets the full dashboards be viewed from myaccount, off-network.

 -- Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>  Tue, 30 Sep 2026 19:00:00 -0500

